    <li>Haughwout, Andrew, Donghoon Lee, Joelle Scally, and Wilbert van der Klaauw, &ldquo;Inequality in U.S. Homeownership Rates by Race and Ethnicity,&rdquo; Federal Reserve Bank of New York <em>Liberty Street Economics</em>, July 8, 2020. (<a rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="offsite" href="https://libertystreeteconomics.newyorkfed.org/2020/07/inequality-in-us-homeownership-rates-by-race-and-ethnicity.html">https://libertystreeteconomics.newyorkfed.org/2020/07/inequality-in-us-homeownership-rates-by-race-and-ethnicity.html</a>)</li>
