    <li>U.S. Census Bureau, American Community Survey, Subject Table S2802, &ldquo;Types of Internet Subscriptions by Selected Characteristics,&rdquo; 2019 1-Year Estimates. (<a rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="offsite" href="https://data.census.gov/cedsci/table?q=S2802">https://data.census.gov/cedsci/table?q=S2802</a>)</li>
    <li>U.S. Census Bureau, American Community Survey, Geographic Comparison Table GCT2801, &ldquo;&lt;<a rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="offsite" href="https://www2.census.gov/programs-surveys/acs/summary_file/2019/data/1_year_geographic_comparison_tables/GCT2801.csv">Percent of Households with a Broadband Internet Subscription</a>,&rdquo; 2019 1-Year Estimates. (<a rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="offsite" href="https://www.census.gov/acs/www/data/data-tables-and-tools/geographic-comparison-tables/">https://www.census.gov/acs/www/data/data-tables-and-tools/geographic-comparison-tables/</a>)</li>
    <li>Wright-McGowan, Margie, &ldquo;The Stakes Are High and There're No Second Chances When It Comes to Preparing Students for Success,&rdquo; remarks at Aim &lsquo;Hire&rsquo;: Workforce and Education Symposium and Fall Series, Ohio Excels and the Governor's Office of Workforce Transformation, Columbus, OH, September 22, 2020. (<a href="/collections/speeches/2020/sp-20200922-wright-mcgowan">https://www.clevelandfed.org/en/newsroom-and-events/speeches/sp-20200922-wright-mcgowan.aspx</a>)</li>
</ul>        </div>
